Silver does *more* damage to undead creatures, but there is only
one type of monster where it makes a huge difference - shades
only appear very deep.  Shades get no regular damage just from
the enchantment level of your weapon and silver.  Wearing a silver
ring works okay for them; wielding a silver weapon does even better.
As does throwing silver items at them.  Too bad there's no way
to whack a monster with your shield, that would make reflection
shields very cool against shades.



